ngm:suggested-reading-order a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Suggested Reading Order"@en ;
    rdfs:comment "Suggested Reading Order is a curated navigation guide that sequences the principal pages of the NarrativeGoldmine knowledge graph into a coherent pedagogical path. It maps the intended conceptual dependencies — from foundational web technologies through decentralisation, digital assets, spatial computing, and AI — enabling readers to build understanding progressively across the graph's interconnected topic areas."@en ;
