    rdfs:comment "The dimensionality of internal representations at each transformer layer, commonly denoted d_model or hidden dimension. Width sets the information-carrying capacity per token and scales the size of attention heads and feed-forward projections, making it a primary axis alongside depth and data volume in neural scaling law research."@en ;
