    rdfs:comment "A self-supervised contrastive learning framework (MoCo) that maintains a dynamically updated queue of encoded negative samples and a momentum encoder — updated as an exponential moving average of the query encoder — to provide large, consistent dictionaries for contrastive loss computation without requiring large batch sizes."@en ;
