    rdfs:label "TELE-050-neural-rendering-telepresence"@en ;
    rdfs:comment "Neural rendering for telepresence is the application of learned, image-synthesis models to reconstruct and display remote people and scenes with photorealistic appearance and free viewpoint control."@en ;
