    rdfs:comment "Adaptive Virtual Experience refers to AI-driven immersive environments that dynamically adjust content, difficulty, pacing, and presentation in real-time based on user behavior, preferences, physiological responses, and interaction patterns to deliver personalized and engaging virtual reality exp..."@en ;
