    rdfs:comment "Adaptive Virtual World describes a metaverse environment that uses procedural generation, AI-driven content creation, and real-time user behavior analysis to dynamically evolve landscapes, structures, weather patterns, NPCs, and game mechanics in response to collective and individual user actions."@en ;
    rdfs:subClassOf [ a owl:Restriction ;
