    rdfs:comment "Seals, in this knowledge graph context, refers to a practical AI pipeline experiment using traditional Chinese seal art (海豹-style stamps) as a five-shot image classification and translation task. The experiment demonstrates multimodal AI capabilities: image analysis via OpenAI vision APIs, English description generation, Chinese translation, and appropriateness ranking, subsequently serialised to JSON for potential NFT metadata enrichment."@en ;
