ngm:consumer-trust a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Consumer Trust"@en ;
    rdfs:comment "Consumer trust is the confidence buyers place in a brand, product, or supply chain to behave reliably, safely, and ethically. It is built through verifiable provenance, transparent practices, consistent quality, and accountable handling of grievances. In supply-chain contexts it is increasingly underpinned by traceability data and ethical-sourcing attestations."@en ;
