    rdfs:label "Backdoor Attack"@en ;
    rdfs:comment "A training-time adversarial attack that embeds a hidden trigger pattern into an AI model via data poisoning, causing the model to behave normally on standard inputs but produce attacker-chosen outputs when the trigger is present, creating a covert vulnerability that survives fine-tuning and is exploitable post-deployment."@en ;
