    rdfs:label "Pathfinding Algorithm"@en ;
    rdfs:comment "A computational algorithm that determines an optimal or near-optimal route between a start and goal node in a graph or spatial environment. Pathfinding algorithms are central to autonomous navigation, game AI, robotics, and metaverse movement systems, with classical examples including Dijkstra's algorithm for shortest paths and A* for heuristic-guided search in spatial graphs."@en ;
    rdfs:subClassOf [ a owl:Restriction ;
