    rdfs:comment "A graded classification (typically 0–5) quantifying the degree to which an agent perceives, decides, and acts without human intervention, ranging from fully manual operation through partial and conditional autonomy to full self-governance, with domain-specific scales for AI, robotics, blockchain DAOs, and multi-agent systems."@en ;
