    rdfs:comment "A standardised JSON-LD 1.1 encoding surface (S1–S11) that exposes agent state, credentials, events, and work metadata in a queryable, linkable format, enabling federated consumption by heterogeneous external systems (monitoring dashboards, compliance audits, blockchain oracles, knowledge grap..."@en ;
