ngm:iso-14067 a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "ISO 14067"@en ;
    rdfs:comment "ISO 14067 is an international standard that specifies principles, requirements, and guidelines for quantifying and reporting the carbon footprint of a product based on life-cycle assessment. It defines how greenhouse-gas emissions associated with a product's life cycle are calculated and communicated, expressed in CO2-equivalent. It provides the methodological backbone for credible product-level carbon-footprint measurement and disclosure."@en ;
