ngm:newcastle-ai-and-health-innovation a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Newcastle AI & Health Innovation"@en ;
    rdfs:comment "Newcastle AI and Health Innovation is the regional technology ecosystem in North East England centred on the application of artificial intelligence to healthcare, life sciences, and digital health, anchored by Newcastle University, Northumbria University, and innovation institutions including the National Innovation Centre for Data and the National Innovation Centre for Ageing. The ecosystem combines academic research, NHS partnerships, and private sector investment to accelerate AI-driven health technology from discovery through to clinical and commercial deployment."@en ;
