    rdfs:comment "LangChain is an open-source Python and TypeScript framework for composing Large Language Model applications as chains of modular components — prompt templates, LLM wrappers, output parsers, memory stores, retrieval augmented generation pipelines, and tool-calling agents — providing a unified ..."@en ;
