ngm:delegate-democracy a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Delegate Democracy"@en ;
    rdfs:comment "Delegate Democracy (also known as liquid democracy, delegative democracy, or proxy democracy) is a hybrid political and organisational governance model — formalised in modern computer-mediated form by Bryan Ford in his 2002 paper Delegative Democracy (Yale, later Swiss EPFL) and intellectuall..."@en ;
