    rdfs:comment "The interconnected network of platforms, protocols, services, and participants that collectively enable the creation, storage, exchange, and utilization of blockchain-based digital assets including cryptocurrencies, tokens, NFTs, and tokenized real-world assets across decentralized and centralize..."@en ;
