    rdfs:comment "A marketplace — centralised or decentralised — where digital assets including cryptocurrencies, NFTs, and tokenised securities are bought, sold, and exchanged. Digital asset markets encompass order-book exchanges, automated market makers, NFT marketplaces, and OTC desks, each governed by distinct liquidity, pricing, and regulatory mechanisms."@en ;
