    rdfs:comment "Software libraries and development environments such as TensorFlow and PyTorch that provide tools, APIs, and abstractions for building, training, and deploying machine learning models; encompassing model definition, automatic differentiation, GPU-accelerated training, and production serving infrastructure."@en ;
