    rdfs:label "ComfyUI Workflows"@en ;
    rdfs:comment "ComfyUI Workflows are node-based directed acyclic graph (DAG) pipelines for Stable Diffusion and broader generative AI inference, implemented within the ComfyUI open-source graphical interface developed by comfyanonymous (first commit January 2023), in which discrete processing operations..."@en ;
