    rdfs:comment "Navigation is the autonomous discipline integrating localisation, mapping, path planning, motion control, and semantic interpretation to enable agents — ground robots, aerial vehicles, autonomous cars, and embodied AI systems — to move reliably from a start configuration to a goal state throu..."@en ;
