ngm:mixture-of-experts-architecture a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Mixture-of-Experts Architecture"@en ;
    rdfs:comment "An architecture that uses multiple specialised sub-networks (experts) with a gating mechanism that routes inputs to a sparse subset of experts, enabling scaling without proportional compute increases. MoE is adopted in production LLMs like GPT-4, enabling massive scale with controlled costs."@en ;
