    rdfs:comment "Cryptography Security and Privacy denotes the cross-disciplinary infrastructure layer combining mathematical primitives (symmetric encryption AES-GCM/ChaCha20-Poly1305/ASCON-128 NIST lightweight finalist February 2023, hash functions SHA-2/SHA-3 Keccak/BLAKE3 throughput 6.8 GB/s single-thread, pa..."@en ;
