    rdfs:comment "An imaging sensor device that captures visual information in robotics and spatial-computing systems, enabling computer vision applications including object detection, SLAM, 3D reconstruction, visual servoing, and semantic scene understanding through various modalities (RGB, depth, thermal, event-based) and sensor technologies (CCD, CMOS, ToF, structured light)."@en ;
