    rdfs:comment "A W3C-standardised URI scheme (DID Core v1.0 Recommendation 19 July 2022, v1.1 Working Draft progressing through 2024-2025) defining globally unique cryptographically verifiable identifiers of the form did:<mod>:<mod-specific-id> controlled directly by their subjects without dependency on c..."@en ;
