    rdfs:comment "Pose estimation is the computational task of inferring the spatial configuration—position, orientation, and joint angles—of a body or rigid object from image or video data, spanning 2D keypoint localisation on the image plane (pixel-coordinate skeleton graphs), 3D joint position regression in cam..."@en ;
