    rdfs:comment "Motion Capture (mocap) is a technology domain and production pipeline discipline encompassing hardware, software, and algorithmic systems that record the position, orientation, and movement of bodies, objects, or faces in three-dimensional space over time — translating real-world kinematic data i..."@en ;
